# UX workflow: copy one Pattern and preview overwrite/free paste targets.
# Purpose: validates clipboard source markers and paste semantics across the
# direct Pattern surface and the explicit Structure / +Next Pattern slot.
# Expect: capture_changed:page_2_copied=paste_preview_overwrite_page_1, capture_changed:paste_hold_overwrite_armed=page_1_overwritten, capture_changed:paste_preview_free_page_3=page_3_pasted

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen pattern_1

# Create Pattern 2 through Structure and return to its musical surface.
150 button NAV down
1220 tick
1280 button NAV up
1480 tap NAV 60
1680 encoder NAV 1
1880 capture screen page_2_add_preview
1980 tap NAV 60
2330 capture screen page_2_created

# Copy Pattern 2, move to Pattern 1, and overwrite it with a guarded hold.
2430 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
2680 capture screen page_2_copied
2780 encoder NAV -1
3030 capture screen paste_preview_overwrite_page_1
3130 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
3680 tick
3730 capture screen paste_hold_overwrite_armed
4230 tick
4280 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
4530 capture screen page_1_overwritten

# A free destination is structural: open Structure, move through Pattern 2 to
# the sole +Next Pattern slot, then paste and confirm the new Pattern 3.
4630 button NAV down
5700 tick
5760 button NAV up
5960 tap NAV 60
6160 encoder NAV 1
6240 encoder NAV 1
6440 capture screen paste_preview_free_page_3
6540 button BOTTOM_RIGHT down
7090 tick
7140 capture screen paste_hold_free_armed
7640 tick
7690 button BOTTOM_RIGHT up
7940 capture screen page_3_pasted_in_structure
8040 tap NAV 60
8340 capture screen page_3_pasted
